  "module_responsibility": {
    "short_summary": {
      "value": "SPI master core that manages serial data transfer, CRC generation, and busy/done handshaking for a single SPI channel.",
      "explanation": "The module has payload data inputs (data_in, TXCRC) and a payload data output (data_out), plus internal assign dependencies for busy, rx_done, tx_done, and crc_done that depend on mode signals (CPHA, DFF, rxonly) and counters. No event inputs or outputs are declared, suggesting it is a data-driven SPI master without external event handshake ports.",
